  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u45fa9fb5\" id=\"u45fa9fb5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u120e59ec\" id=\"u120e59ec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">一个最简单的Linux驱动主要由以下几个部分组成。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua2d7d37a\" id=\"ua2d7d37a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u582be76a\" id=\"u582be76a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">（1）头文件（必须有）<br />\t驱动需要包含内核相关头文件。必须包含 </span><code data-lake-id=\"udcc37dd9\" id=\"udcc37dd9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub70411df\" id=\"ub70411df\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">&lt;linux/module.h&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub93b6041\" id=\"ub93b6041\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5dd7ca00\" id=\"u5dd7ca00\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50e021a7\" id=\"u50e021a7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">&lt;linux/init.h&gt;</span></code></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1c079652\" id=\"u1c079652\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub598f844\" id=\"ub598f844\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">（2）驱动加载函数。（必须有）<br />\t当加载驱动的时候，驱动加载函数会自动被内核执行。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufe67666a\" id=\"ufe67666a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u57c37cec\" id=\"u57c37cec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">（3）驱动卸载函数（必须有）<br />\t当卸载驱动的时候，驱动卸载函数会自动被内核执行。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uea765705\" id=\"uea765705\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud472fd65\" id=\"ud472fd65\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">（4）许可证声明（必须有）<br />\tLinux内核是开源的，遵守GPL协议，驱动在加载的时候也要遵守相关的协议，可以接收的License有“GPL”、“GPL v2”、“GPL and additional rights”、“Dual BSD/GPL”、“Dual MIT/GPL”、“Dual MPL/GPL”。内核驱动中最常见的是GPL v2。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud94cf67a\" id=\"ud94cf67a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u728b5d48\" id=\"u728b5d48\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">（5）模块参数（可选）<br />\t模块参数是模块被加载的时候传递给内核模块的值。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2045f2ac\" id=\"u2045f2ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9779e58b\" id=\"u9779e58b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">（6）作者和版本信息（可选）<br />\t可以声明驱动的作者信息和代码的版本信息。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Clinux%2Fmodule.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Clinux%2Fkernel.h%3E%20%5Cn%23include%20%3Clinux%2Finit.h%3E%5Cnstatic%20int%20__init%20helloworld_init(void)%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctprintk(KERN_EMERG%20%5C%22helloworld_init%5C%5Cr%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnstatic%20void%20__exit%20helloworld_exit(void)%20%20%20%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctprintk(KERN_EMERG%20%5C%22helloworld_exit%5C%5Cr%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnmodule_init(helloworld_init)%3B%20%20%20%20%5Cnmodule_exit(helloworld_exit)%3B%20%20%20%5CnMODULE_LICENSE(%5C%22GPL%20v2%5C%22)%3B%20%20%20%20%5CnMODULE_AUTHOR(%5C%22topeet%5C%22)%3B%20%5CnMODULE_VERSION(%5C%221.0%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XUAqc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u115b2c61\" id=\"u115b2c61\"><p data-lake-id=\"uf9309eb7\" id=\"uf9309eb7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u32102905\" id=\"u32102905\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">在 Linux 内核模块编程中</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u284f20f2\" id=\"u284f20f2\"><code data-lake-id=\"ub974b90a\" id=\"ub974b90a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c7eb37b\" id=\"u3c7eb37b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">__init</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc2f0906a\" id=\"uc2f0906a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 是一个 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaf32f26a\" id=\"uaf32f26a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数属性宏（function attribute macro）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ueeb4d4b5\" id=\"ueeb4d4b5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">，用于告诉内核：</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6ea5642f\" id=\"u6ea5642f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">这个函数只在模块初始化（加载）时使用，初始化完成后，它的代码可以被安全释放，以节省内存。</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7f6201f6\" id=\"u7f6201f6\"><code data-lake-id=\"u5357ee30\" id=\"u5357ee30\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue93b4234\" id=\"ue93b4234\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">__exit</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8da9ece7\" id=\"u8da9ece7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 是一个 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2c13d3d2\" id=\"u2c13d3d2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">函数属性宏（function attribute macro）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4cefc35a\" id=\"u4cefc35a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">，和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u23bcb7db\" id=\"u23bcb7db\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0f13c76\" id=\"ud0f13c76\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">__init</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue23a5296\" id=\"ue23a5296\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 类似，它用于标记一个函数是 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubbeea93a\" id=\"ubbeea93a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">模块卸载时使用的清理函数</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc983180c\" id=\"uc983180c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">。内核会在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uae501348\" id=\"uae501348\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">模块被卸载时调用这个函数</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u054677b4\" id=\"u054677b4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">，并在调用后（或在某些情况下）</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud2a036eb\" id=\"ud2a036eb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">安全地丢弃它的代码以节省内存</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u796df196\" id=\"u796df196\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">。</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"uac1993ea\" id=\"uac1993ea\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36c9b7f8\" id=\"u36c9b7f8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9c789703\" id=\"u9c789703\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8de03992\" id=\"u8de03992\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">​</span><br></p>",
